<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.807 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.807 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS600 million   5.807	 5.78-5.82   5.825</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$400 million, pct allotted at top 30)</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS200 million   5.870	 5.870 only  5.895</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 100)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   5.788	 5.76-5.79   5.807</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$300 million, pct allotted at top 79)</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
